      - /url: https://fugro.canto.global/direct/document/n3gspiu4j10b91uslh09epl81l/2hOKQib-nm_M2KkJGFRHpMZZwO0/original?content-type=application%2Fpdf&name=Fugro+awarded+major+Australian+marine+asset+integrity+contract+-+Press+Release.pdf
